    /// # Safety
    /// Bounded pure operation over caller-owned storage. No allocation, I/O, GPU access, retained pointer or compilation. Rejection preserves all outputs.
    /// Blocking: nonblocking; threading: thread_safe; reentrancy: reentrant.
